# Terminology overlay of the AutoCAD-like profile (en-US). Each message replaces the
# message with the same id. The words are our own; no vendor text is copied.
# Vectorworks "Class" becomes "Layer", and "Design Layer" becomes "Drawing", so the bare word
# "Layer" means one thing only. Sheet layers become "Layouts".
panels-layer = Drawing
panels-class = Layer
panels-design-layers = Drawings
panels-add-design-layer = Add Drawing
panels-classes = Layers
panels-add-class = Add Layer
panels-lock-layer = Lock drawing
panels-override-the-class-attribute = Override the layer attribute
panels-nothing-selected-active-layer-active-class =
    Nothing selected.
    Active drawing: { $layer }
    Active layer: { $class }
sheets-ui-sheet-layers = Layouts
sheets-ui-add-sheet-layer = Add Layout
app-add-a-sheet-layer-first-navigation-sheet = Add a layout first (Navigation > Layouts > +)
io-dialog-dxf-layers-become-design-layers-default-classes = DXF layers become drawings (default: layers)
io-dialog-building-storeys-become-design-layers-off-all = Building storeys become drawings (off: all on the active drawing)
io-dialog-class-from-attribute = Layer from attribute
io-dialog-design-layer = Drawing
io-dialog-classes-become-ifc-presentation-layers = Layers become IFC presentation layers
io-dialog-design-layers-become-building-storeys-default-everyt = Drawings become building storeys (default: everything in the site)
io-dialog-one-dxf-layer-per-design-layer-default = One DXF layer per drawing (default: per layer)
io-dialog-only-visible-layers-and-classes = Only visible drawings and layers
plant-ui-off-use-the-class-color = Off: use the layer color
plant-ui-no-site-model-on-the-layer-of = No site model on the drawing of this plant
plant-ui-back-to-the-elevation-of-the-layer = Back to the elevation of the drawing
snap-ui-snap-to-other-layers = Snap to other drawings
snap-ui-off-only-objects-of-the-active-layer = Off: only objects of the active drawing.
snap-ui-snap-to-grey-layers-and-classes = Snap to grey drawings and layers
snap-ui-objects-of-grey-layers-and-classes-cannot = Objects of grey drawings and layers cannot be picked. This lets the pointer snap to them.
area-ui-the-formation-level-under-the-build-up = The formation level under the build-up changes the proposed surface of the site model on this drawing
data-ui-add-the-worksheet-as-a-table-on = Add the worksheet as a table on the active drawing
uic-annot-tool-click-to-place-the-scale-bar-it = Click to place the scale bar. It follows the scale of the drawing.
action-tool-select = Select
action-cmd-duplicate-array = Array
array-ui-duplicate-array = Array
panels-duplicate-array = Array...
action-databar-focus = Dynamic input: next field
action-databar-prev = Dynamic input: previous field
panels-radius-of-new-arc-vertices-type-a = Radius of new arc vertices. Type a value in dynamic input (Tab) in Arc mode.
plant-ui-none-use-the-data-bar = (none: use dynamic input)
uic-tools-pick-a-mode-in-the-data-bar = Pick a mode in dynamic input: landscape wall, grade, spot elevation, stake or section line. Esc cancels.
uic-tools-click-to-place-set-values-in-the = Click to place. Set values in dynamic input.
